  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCP - Support to the Pacific Climate Change Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Climate Change Centre (PCCC) is a regional asset committed to the resilient development of Pacific Island Countries and Territories. MFAT&#x2019;s support of the PCCC has primarily provided funding for staff salaries since 2019.&#xa0;The goal of this activity is that the PCCC becomes a globally respected Centre of Excellence for climate change issues, that is highly valued for training and support to assist adaptation and mitigation actions, through the provision of quality staff.</narrative>
  </description>
